{"title":"Career Roadmap: Forensic Auditor","role":"Forensic Auditor","summary":"Career Domain: Business, Finance & Entrepreneurship · Qualification Pathway: Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India – Chartered Accountancy (CA - ICAI) · Target Career: Forensic Auditor","facts":{"Current degree":"Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India","Course":"Chartered Accountancy (CA - ICAI)"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Forensic Auditor investigates fraud and financial wrongdoing - following the money, finding evidence and reporting for courts, regulators and companies."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Forensic Auditor does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investigate suspected fraud and irregularities"},{"text":"Analyse transactions and records"},{"text":"Collect and document evidence"},{"text":"Write reports and support legal cases"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Big 4 forensic teams"},{"text":"Banks (fraud risk)"},{"text":"Investigation agencies and regulators"},{"text":"Own forensic practice"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Associate"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Forensic Auditor"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Director"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Partner"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Foundation: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Foundation"},{"text":"Learn accounting well"},{"text":"Read about famous fraud cases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Intermediate: Core skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Intermediate"},{"text":"Audit and law focus"},{"text":"Learn data analysis in Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Articleship: Investigation exposure"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Try for forensic or bank-audit work"},{"text":"Learn audit trails and evidence"},{"text":"Learn IDEA / ACL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final and career: Qualify and specialise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear CA Final"},{"text":"Take ICAI's FAFD certificate"},{"text":"Join a forensic team"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Forensic accounting"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Evidence and documentation"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Fraud law basics"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Scepticism"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Discretion"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Clear reporting"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IDEA / ACL"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Forensic software"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Big 4 forensic"},{"text":"Bank audits"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICAI FAFD (Forensic Accounting and Fraud Detection)"},{"text":"CFE (Association of Certified Fraud Examiners)"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ICAI certificate courses"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exa